minmea
------------------------------------------
Minmea is a minimalistic GPS parser library written in pure C intended for
resource-constrained platforms, especially microcontrollers and other embedded
systems.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libminmea-devel-1.0.0-1bl1
  libminmea1-1.0.0-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  check-0.15.2-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/kosma/minmea

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/kosma/minmea/archive/v1.0.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack minmea-1.0.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./minmea-1.0.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/minmea-1.0.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/minmea-1.0.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libminmea1-1.0.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libminmea-devel-1.0.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(minmea)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/minmea.README
  /usr/share/doc/minmea/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/minmea/LICENSE.LGPL-3.0
  /usr/share/doc/minmea/LICENSE.MIT
  /usr/share/doc/minmea/LICENSE.grants
  /usr/share/doc/minmea/README.md

(libminmea1)
  /usr/bin/cygminmea-1.dll

(libminmea-devel)
  /usr/include/minmea.h
  /usr/lib/libminmea.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/minmea.pc

